```spl
`SOC Lab Detection Rule`
`Rule Name: Suspicious Executable Execution from User-Writable Paths`
`Event ID: 1 (Process Create)`
`MITRE ATT&CK: T1059 (Command and Scripting Interpreter), T1204.002 (User Execution: Malicious File)`
`Severity: High`
`Data Source: XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational | index=blue`
`Description: Detects execution of executables originating from Temp, AppData, Downloads, Public, Desktop, or ProgramData folders.`
```

index=blue EventCode=1
| eval Process_Path=coalesce(Image,image)
| where match(Process_Path,"(?i)\\(temp|appdata|downloads|public|desktop|programdata)\\") AND match(Process_Path,"(?i)\.exe$")
| table _time host User Process_Path ParentImage CommandLine ProcessId ParentProcessId
| sort - _time
